10017 IF VAL(P$(I))>VAL(R$) THEN P$(I+1)=P$(I):NEXT I ELSE IF VAL(P$(I))=VAL(R$) THEN P$(I+1)=R$:GOSUB 10050  ELSE P$(I+1)=R$
10020 RETURN
10050 FOR B=I+1 TO N
10060 P$(B-1)=P$(B)
